OrangeIslands_Sunburst_Glassworks_Text_Daughter::
	.string "He went down into the cave once,\n"
	.string "years ago, and came back up\l"
	.string "without his tools.\p"
	.string "He has never said why.\n"
	.string "He has never gone back either.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_Glassworks_Text_Apprentice::
	.string "The sand here is wrong, you know.\n"
	.string "Too much of the hill in it.\p"
	.string "Melt it and it comes out clear as\n"
	.string "water and twice as hard. That is\l"
	.string "not the sand doing that.\p"
	.string "That is whatever the hill is made\n"
	.string "of.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_Glassworks_Text_Glassblower::
	.string "Glass that sings. That is the\n"
	.string "trick of this island's sand.\p"
	.string "Five flutes, five notes. BLUE\n"
	.string "wakes a sleeping POKeMON. YELLOW\l"
	.string "shakes the confusion out of one.\l"
	.string "RED cools a head gone soft.\p"
	.string "Then the pair nobody believes\n"
	.string "until they try them. WHITE draws\l"
	.string "POKeMON to you. BLACK keeps them\l"
	.string "off.\p"
	.string "Take a BLACK one down that cave\n"
	.string "and you will reach the bottom\l"
	.string "with something left in the tank.$"

